School Access Revoked - <%= @school.name %>

Dear <%= @user.display_name %>,

We are writing to inform you that your management access for <%= @school.name %> has been revoked.

School Information:
- Name: <%= @school.name %>
<% if @school.display_address.present? -%>
- Address: <%= @school.display_address %>
<% end -%>
- Access Revoked: <%= @school_claim.revoked_at.strftime("%B %d, %Y at %I:%M %p") %>

<% if @school_claim.revocation_reason.present? -%>
Reason for Revocation:
<%= @school_claim.revocation_reason %>

<% end -%>
What This Means:
- You no longer have access to edit the school's information
- You cannot manage the school's pages, photos, or other content
- The school listing is now available for new claims
- Your account remains active, but access to this specific school has been removed

Next Steps:
If you believe this revocation was made in error or if your circumstances have changed, you may submit a new claim for this school. Please ensure you have proper documentation of your current role or authorization.

If you have questions about this revocation, please contact our support team.

You can submit a new claim at: <%= new_for_school_anonymous_claims_url(@school.id) %>

Thank you for your understanding. We maintain these access controls to ensure school information is managed by authorized personnel.

If you have any questions or concerns, please don't hesitate to contact our support team.